      "persona": "Whitehat Hacker",
      "questName": "Sherlock - Digital Footprint Audit",
      "questDescription": "Kwame asks you to compare the supplied public-footprint results for five TechNova staff members. Use the in-game Sherlock command to find which result includes personal material, then identify the specific detail that could make a targeted message more convincing. Treat the results as leads that need verification.",
      "questCompleteText": "<b>Kwame:</b> Brian Simpson's result contains family photos and personal blog references alongside a professional profile. You identified the added social-engineering risk without assuming the records prove account compromise or that anyone has used the information.",
